<view class="page" wx:if="{{profile && platform}}">
  <view class="result-hero" style="background: {{platform.color}};">
    <view class="result-icon">{{platform.icon}}</view>
    <view class="result-kicker" style="color: {{platform.accent}};">{{platform.name}} · {{platform.viewName}}</view>
    <view class="result-title">这个平台，只看见了这一部分你。</view>
    <view class="result-summary">{{profile.summary}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">算法从这些痕迹开始猜</view>
  <view class="projection-stage">
    <view class="projection-avatar">
      <view class="avatar-head"></view>
      <view class="avatar-torso"></view>
      <view class="avatar-arm left"></view>
      <view class="avatar-arm right"></view>
      <view class="avatar-leg left"></view>
      <view class="avatar-leg right"></view>
      <view wx:for="{{visualFragments}}" wx:key="id" class="avatar-fragment" style="{{item.style}}"></view>
    </view>

    <view wx:for="{{visualInferences}}" wx:key="id" class="inference-node {{item.positionClass}} {{item.feedbackClass}}">
      <view class="node-dot" style="background: {{platform.accent}};"></view>
      <view class="node-axis">{{item.axisLabel}} · {{item.confidence}}把握</view>
      <view class="node-text">{{item.statement}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{profile.inferences.length === 0}}" class="empty-card">
    当前行为痕迹还没有形成足够一致的方向。系统选择暂时不猜。
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">每一条推断都可以被你否定</view>
  <view class="inference-list">
    <view wx:for="{{profile.inferences}}" wx:key="id" class="inference-card {{item.feedback ? 'has-feedback' : ''}} {{item.feedback === 'inaccurate' ? 'is-rejected' : ''}}">
      <view class="inference-line">{{item.line}}</view>
      <view class="inference-detail">{{item.detail}}</view>
      <view class="feedback-row">
        <button class="feedback-button {{item.feedback === 'accurate' ? 'active accurate' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-status="accurate" bindtap="feedback">比较像我</button>
        <button class="feedback-button {{item.feedback === 'unsure' ? 'active unsure' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-status="unsure" bindtap="feedback">不确定</button>
        <button class="feedback-button {{item.feedback === 'inaccurate' ? 'active inaccurate' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-status="inaccurate" bindtap="feedback">完全不是</button>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.feedback === 'inaccurate'}}" class="misread-note">算法看到了行为，却可能误解了原因。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{profile.neutralAxes.length > 0 || profile.unobservedAxes.length > 0}}" class="section-title">这一面，算法还没看清</view>
  <view wx:if="{{profile.neutralAxes.length > 0 || profile.unobservedAxes.length > 0}}" class="unknown-card">
    <view wx:for="{{profile.neutralAxes}}" wx:key="id" class="unknown-row">
      <view class="unknown-name">{{item.label}}</view>
      <view class="unknown-value">暂无明显行为倾向</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:for="{{profile.unobservedAxes}}" wx:key="id" class="unknown-row">
      <view class="unknown-name">{{item.label}}</view>
      <view class="unknown-value muted">尚未充分观察</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="merge-cta" bindtap="goMerge">
    <view class="merge-kicker">把不同视角拼起来</view>
    <view class="merge-title">看看目前的数字分身 →</view>
    <view class="merge-desc">每个平台只贡献一部分外在痕迹，没有任何一个平台等于完整的你。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions">
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="redo">重新观察</button>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="goPlatforms">继续解锁其他视角</button>
  </view>

  <view class="disclaimer">本工具仅做行为模拟推演，不是人格判定或心理评估。推断不一定代表真实情况。</view>
</view>
